# Curriculum rules

- Every mechanism claim carries `[n]` resolving to `bibliography.md`. No
  invented Cursor features: bibliography-or-it-doesn't-exist.
- Step files follow `specs/step-schema.md` (tabs, closers, frontmatter).
- Points sum to 520 across `steps/` (80/80/70/55/65/70/100). Re-verify on change.
- `tracks.md` is canonical for version/persona sets; `site/src/lib/tracks.ts`
  mirrors them. Verify exact agreement, including persona intersections.
- The unofficial disclaimer stays on every site route.
- Third-party claims carry `[third-party]` per `specs/citation-format.md`.
- New claims get a `fact-check.md` row (claim/source/date/verdict).
